  "text": "Passive Tree\nEarly\nnon-crit Midgame\nnon-crit Hybrid swap\nCrit Hybrid\nUber Endgame\nLive Gear\nMain:\n-23\n129\nSet 1:\n0\n24\nSet 2:\n0\n24\nNotable Priority\nTrack Build\n+24\nShow All\n\nCan only swap to pathfinder when you're strong and don't notice the defense/damage loss from swapping off of deadeye. Pathfinder is pure utility for cannot be slowed/sprint knockdown immune.\n\nEvery small node if possible should be 5% increased damage from \nTraveller's Wisdom\n (some nodes will need to stay as attribute for requirements). \nLegacy of Greymake\n helps with attributes.\n\nPathfinder Ascendancy nodes\n\nRelentless Pursuit\n/ \nRunning Assault\n/ \nPath Seeker\n/ \nTraveller's Wisdom\n\n(Doesn't matter which patch you take for path seeker, just taking it for the extra skill points."
